@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram

[*] --> MenuScreen

state MenuScreen <<choice>>
state AmountSelectionScreen
state TransactionVerificationScreen
state ReenterAmountScreen

MenuScreen : entry / User starts at menu screen
MenuScreen : do / Show options to select amount or enter custom value
MenuScreen : exit / User selects an option

AmountSelectionScreen : entry / User selected an amount from the list
AmountSelectionScreen : do / Verify transaction
AmountSelectionScreen : exit / Transaction verified

TransactionVerificationScreen : entry / Transaction verification initiated
TransactionVerificationScreen : do / Verify transaction
TransactionVerificationScreen : exit / Transaction verified or rejected

ReenterAmountScreen : entry / Transaction was rejected
ReenterAmountScreen : do / Allow user to re-enter amount
ReenterAmountScreen : exit / User re-enters an amount

TransactionVerificationScreen --> ReenterAmountScreen : TransactionRejected
TransactionVerificationScreen --> [*] : TransactionSuccessful

MenuScreen --> AmountSelectionScreen : UserSelectsAmountFromList or UserEntersCustomValue

@enduml
